# Chronicle of Victory (Elf chosen) pumps "creatures you control of the chosen type" (CR 205.3m) the moment it arrives,
# one already on the battlefield; an Ornithopter of Bot1's (a Thopter) and Bot2's own Elvish Mystic are untouched, and
# neither Bot1's Ornithopter nor Bot2's Elvish Mystic draws Bot1 a card: the trigger is "you cast a spell of the chosen
# type". Bot2's Disenchant then destroys the Chronicle and the Mystic is a 1/1 without first strike or trample again.

